ajglobe.min.js: the ES module bundle of https://github.com/ajfriend/ajglobe
at v0.0.4 (pointer mapping in the canvas's own pixel frame, so drags are
right inside a CSS-scaled reveal.js slide; consumed keys stop propagating
to the host; zoom 1 fits the globe in a canvas of any aspect). dist/ is not committed there
and the package is not on npm yet, so it is vendored.
Rebuild: `just build` in the ajglobe checkout, copy dist/ajglobe.min.js.
